 414:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 415:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Function description
 416:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Stores a specified number of characters in SEGGER RTT ring buffer
 417:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    and updates the associated write pointer which is periodically
 418:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    read by the host.
 419:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    It is callers responsibility to make sure data actually fits in buffer.
