 421:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Parameters
 422:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    pRing        Ring buffer to post to.
 423:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    pBuffer      Pointer to character array. Does not need to point to a \0 terminated string.
 424:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    NumBytes     Number of bytes to be stored in the SEGGER RTT control block.
 425:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 426:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Notes
 427:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (1) If there might not be enough space in the "Up"-buffer, call _WriteBlocking
 428:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** */
 429:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** static void _WriteNoCheck(SEGGER_RTT_BUFFER_UP* pRing, const char* pData, unsigned NumBytes) {
