 537:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** /*********************************************************************
 538:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 539:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *       Public code
 540:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
