 547:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 548:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Function description
 549:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Reads characters from SEGGER real-time-terminal control block
 550:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    which have been previously stored by the application.
 551:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Do not lock against interrupts and multiple access.
 552:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Used to do the same operation that J-Link does, to transfer
 553:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    RTT data via other channels, such as TCP/IP or UART.
 554:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 555:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Parameters
 556:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferIndex  Index of Up-buffer to be used.
 557:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    pBuffer      Pointer to buffer provided by target application, to copy characters from RTT-up-
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccZ5iSyA.s 			page 23


 558:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferSize   Size of the target application buffer.
 559:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 560:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Return value
 561:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Number of bytes that have been read.
 562:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 563:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Additional information
 564:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    This function must not be called when J-Link might also do RTT.
 565:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** */
