 654:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 655:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Return value
 656:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Number of bytes that have been read.
 657:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** */
