 991:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 992:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *       SEGGER_RTT_WriteDownBufferNoLock
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccZ5iSyA.s 			page 46


 993:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 994:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Function description
 995:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Stores a specified number of characters in SEGGER RTT
 996:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    control block inside a <Down> buffer.
 997:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    SEGGER_RTT_WriteDownBufferNoLock does not lock the application.
 998:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Used to do the same operation that J-Link does, to transfer
 999:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    RTT data from other channels, such as TCP/IP or UART.
1000:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1001:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Parameters
1002:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferIndex  Index of "Down"-buffer to be used.
1003:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    pBuffer      Pointer to character array. Does not need to point to a \0 terminated string.
1004:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    NumBytes     Number of bytes to be stored in the SEGGER RTT control block.
1005:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1006:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Return value
1007:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Number of bytes which have been stored in the "Down"-buffer.
1008:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1009:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Notes
1010:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (1) Data is stored according to buffer flags.
1011:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (2) For performance reasons this function does not call Init()
1012:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *        and may only be called after RTT has been initialized.
1013:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *        Either by calling SEGGER_RTT_Init() or calling another RTT API function first.
1014:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1015:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Additional information
1016:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    This function must not be called when J-Link might also do RTT.
1017:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** */
