1143:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** 
1144:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** /*********************************************************************
1145:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1146:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *       SEGGER_RTT_WriteDownBuffer
1147:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1148:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Function description
1149:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Stores a specified number of characters in SEGGER RTT control block in a <Down> buffer.
1150:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1151:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Parameters
1152:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferIndex  Index of "Up"-buffer to be used (e.g. 0 for "Terminal").
1153:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    pBuffer      Pointer to character array. Does not need to point to a \0 terminated string.
1154:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    NumBytes     Number of bytes to be stored in the SEGGER RTT control block.
1155:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1156:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Return value
1157:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Number of bytes which have been stored in the "Down"-buffer.
1158:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1159:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Notes
1160:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (1) Data is stored according to buffer flags.
1161:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1162:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Additional information
1163:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    This function must not be called when J-Link might also do RTT.
1164:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    This function locks against all other RTT operations. I.e. during
1165:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    the write operation, writing from the application is also locked.
1166:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    If only one consumer writes to the down buffer,
